      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Glaneagle is locaed on the Sheep's Head Peninsula. 13 kn from Bantry, 7km from Durrus and 4 km from Ahakista. It has panoramic and idyllic views of nearby Glanlough Lake as well as of Bantry Bay. Extending to 106 sq m, the property has been comprehensively renovated in 2025 and 2026 and presents in turnkey condition, effectively comparable to a new build. Every aspect of the house has been overhauled. BER rating is A. The plot extends to almost 1 acre. The entire plot has been fenced off and landscaped., upgraded drainage with a new septic tank and soakaway installed with private well water. The interior is bright, welcoming and designed for modern living. It features a spacious open plan kitchen, living and dining area with a new modern wood burning stove that can heat the whole house. Spacious master bedroom, dressing room, bathroom with natural light and a rain shower. 2nd bedroom to be used as a guest room, utility room.\r\nServices:  Smart heat pump,5kw solar system, underfloor heating, waste water treatment plant, well water, broadband available"
      },
